  'remove-session':id=>{const original=state.sessions.find(s=>s.id===id);openModal('移除这一段误记',`<div class="preview-box"><h3>${e(original.name)}</h3><p>${D.dateKey(original.start,state.timeZone)} ${V.clock(original.start,state.timeZone)} — ${V.clock(original.end,state.timeZone)} · ${V.duration((original.end-original.start)/60000)}</p></div><p>移除这段计时，原范围留为空白；成长与阶段投入按剩余记录重算。照片、文字会保留为原日期的独立片段。成果完成、适用自评和今日计时保留。</p><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" required>这段时间是误记，我确认移除</label>`,{submit:'确认移除计时',onSubmit:async(f,op)=>{await save(s=>D.removeSession(s,id,original.version),{operationId:op});closeModal();toast('误记已移除，图文与独立判断保留');}});},
